{"kind":"request","text":"C3: requests. Third build step of the client design note. Read\nsections 4, 6, 7, 9 and 12 of\n`notes/2026-11-13-scope-client.md` at commit 847d5542.\n\nWork, in the entry `@generalbusiness/dap-client/scope`:\n1. `scopeClient(handle, { signer, store, drafts })`, with one\n   internal call that takes a key, a kind and values, and makes\n   a request. C4 puts `submit` on it.\n2. Rules 3, 5 and 6 of section 4: the client signs only at that\n   call, builds the intent at the replica's head, and sends old\n   bytes only when a live signing equals the built intent apart\n   from `notAfter`.\n3. The six ordered status rules of section 6, as one pure\n   function of the replica, the custody record, the draft store\n   and the clock. Export it.\n4. Section 6.1: an answer waits for its head, and an answer is\n   a reason to read the journal at once.\n5. Section 6.3: a reason of class `protocol` stops the client.\n6. Section 7: the one schedule and the one timer. For a dead\n   signing with a copy that has no answer, the client calls\n   `absent` at the first journal read after the death that\n   reaches the head. A read that fails does not count.\n7. For each folded entry of its own signer, the client calls\n   `folded`.\n8. `view.requests`, `predicted`, and `row({ key })` before and\n   after the entry.\n\nTests: the generated suite of section 12 without the draft\nsteps, with two clocks. Invariants 1, 3, 5, 6 and 7 hold after\neach step. State the suite's duration. One case for each row of\nthe table in section 7.\n\nNeeds: C1 and C2 on main.","body":{"conditions":"The head lands on main with the gate passed and the checker's approval. The status of a request is one exported pure function with the six ordered rules. The client signs only at a request call. The generated suite without draft steps passes with invariants 1, 3, 5, 6 and 7, and its duration is stated.","target_head":"64112e4576b4c3c8fb668389786deb6b703da417","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}